1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,218
Your whole job is weighing trucks at night,
and every watt you use brings the dark closer.

2
00:00:05,468 --> 00:00:08,178
When the battery dies,
you have to go outside.

3
00:00:10,428 --> 00:00:16,952
The Weigh Station. You check each driver's manifest on an amber screen,
weigh the truck, and seal the booth door.

4
00:00:17,202 --> 00:00:21,166
It's a paperwork game,
with something waiting past the floodlights.

5
00:00:21,416 --> 00:00:25,014
It's about one point three gigabytes,
in thirteen languages.

6
00:00:25,414 --> 00:00:28,124
Worth a dip if you liked
checking papers in the dark.

7
00:00:28,524 --> 00:00:31,809
That's Demo Dip.
A new Steam demo, every day.
